  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EDP, support to Agasaro organic ltd in pineapple value chain</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is an Enterprise Development Programme (EDP) support to Agasaro organic ltd which is an enterprise involved in pineapple processing of different products that include pineapple juice, pineapple biscuits and pineapple jam. as EDP operates, this support will be in the form of loan and grant, loan will be implemented in partnership with a financial institution which will provide loan and EDP providing guarantee and negotiation for better loan term; e.g interest rate, grace period.  One part of the loan will serve as working capital while the other part will be a long -term loan; 5 years for purchasing a packaging machine. The grant part will support on organising and strengthening the organic fresh pineapple chain. This includes training of farmers on organic farming , providing farming materials to farmers, constructing collection centres for reducing harvest losses due to high perishability.  The Oxfam/EDP funds will add value and achieve these targets:  - Availing an adequate working capital  - Packaging material up to the standards  - Technical support to pineapple farmers;  - Increase the area of organic pineapple production from 120 to 220 ha,  - Increase number of organic farmers from 540 to 800 and strengthen capacity of their cooperatives through cooperative management trainings.  - Improve the supply chain of fresh pineapple and increase current price per unit from Rwf80 up to Rwf150per kg;  - Marketing and business development services  - Relocating the biscuit processing plant to the new Musanze industrial park (the cost for this activity will be covered by the entrepreneur)</narrative>
  </description>
